# Copy to .env and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# All credentials are read through the secrets component:
#
#   (require '[{{top/ns}}.{{main/ns}}.secrets.interface :as secrets])
#   (def s (secrets/load-secrets))
#   (secrets/get-secret s "OPENAI_API_KEY")
#
# Real environment variables take precedence over values in this file.

# Example keys — uncomment and fill in what your bases actually need:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/app_dev
